ong>Trimethylamine (TMA)</strong></td><td>≤ 300 ppm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Apparent Density</strong></td><td>~500 kg/m³</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Particle Size</strong></td><td>≥ 95% passes through 20 mesh sieve</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Solubility</strong></td><td>Completely soluble in water</td></tr></tbody></table><hr/><h2><strong>Shelf Life &amp; Storage</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Shelf Life:</strong> 18 months from production date</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> Keep in original, unopened packaging in a <strong>cool, dry place away from sunlight</strong></li><li><strong>Handling:</strong> Hygroscopic – reseal bags tightly after use to maintain quality</li></ul><hr/><h2><strong>Applications by Species</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Poultry (broilers, layers, breeders):</strong> Improves weight gain, feed conversion, egg production, and hatchability</li><li><strong>Swine:</strong> Prevents perosis, enhances growth, improves litter size</li><li><strong>Ruminants:</strong> Reduces ketosis, improves milk yield, supports liver function</li><li><strong>Aquaculture:</strong> Enhances growth, feed efficiency, and survival rates in fish and shrimp</li><li><strong>Pet Nutrition:</strong> Supports metabolism, healthy skin, and liver function</li></ul><hr/><h2><strong>Usage Recommendations</strong></h2><ul><li>Follow local nutritional standards or consult a <strong>feed nutritionist</strong> for optimal inclusion rates</li><li>Can be incorporated into <strong>premixes, concentrates, or compound feeds</strong></li><li>Adjust dosage depending on <strong>species, growth stage, and production goals</strong></li></ul><hr/><h2><strong>Packaging Options</strong></h2><ul><li>25 kg kraft paper bags with PE inner liner</li><li>625 kg jumbo bags for bulk supply</li><li>Customized packaging available</li></ul><hr/><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Choline Chloride 50%?</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Consistent Quality:</strong> Produced under strict QC with guaranteed active content</li><li><strong>Optimized Particle Size:</strong> Ensures uniform mixing in feed mills</li><li><strong>Flexible Supply:</strong> Standard and bulk packaging options</li><li><strong>Technical Support:</strong> Professional guidance on feed formulation and inclusion rates</li><li><strong>Global Export Experience:</strong> Compliant with international feed additive regulations (FAMI-QS, ISO 9001, GB/T standards)</li></ul><hr/>`} />
